<title>USA: Trump Hotels names finance vice president.</title>
<headline>Trump Hotels names finance vice president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trump Hotels &amp; Casino Resorts Inc said Friday it named R. Bruce McKee senior vice president of corporate finance.</p>
<p>McKee had been president and chief operating office of Trump Castle, which is in the process of being renamed Trump Marina Hotel Casino, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said John Belisle has been named president and chief operating officer of Trump Castle, replacing McKee.</p>
</text>
